WEBVTT

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:36.580
Damn.

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:43.260
Adios.

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:49.930
I'm taking back the Ark.

00:00:56.350 --> 00:00:58.440
Too late, Mikhail.

00:00:58.900 --> 00:01:03.740
Unfortunately,
the Ark is already inside me.

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:09.950
Yuliy.

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:13.660
Damn.

00:01:26.010 --> 00:01:26.840
Yuliy.

00:01:35.100 --> 00:01:36.140
Professor.

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:50.070
EPISODE 12
THE ARK OF SIRIUS

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:53.580
Are you all right?

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:58.750
Maybe that was a bit rough,
as far as landings go.

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:02.500
-What? You crashed the plane.
-Yeah, yeah, apologies for that.

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:06.170
You're not going to be the pilot,
ever again.

00:02:06.470 --> 00:02:07.300
Guys.

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:10.720
-Are you okay?
-Ryoko?

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:15.470
-And the gentleman from that one time.
-Why would you do such a crazy thing?

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:18.100
Look who's talking.

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:20.600
It's your love for Yuliy
that's driving you.

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:22.770
Dorothea. Stop it.

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:24.650
Did the transceiver from earlier
come in handy?

00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:28.360
Yeah, for our boss.

00:02:28.820 --> 00:02:30.820
I see. So...

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:32.700
Now...

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:44.090
The Ark... You...

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:47.800
Yes. I have become the vessel of the Ark.

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:50.840
Thus the force of the Ark resides
within me.

00:02:51.090 --> 00:02:53.470
My soul has become united with the Ark,

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:57.810
and now I have become an existence
far beyond human wisdom.

00:03:01.310 --> 00:03:02.980
Amazing, Master Yev.

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:05.400
Now you can cure everyone's illness.

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:07.900
-That's foolish.
-What?

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:12.780
With this power,
eradication of a disease is very easy.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:16.490
But it's not even worth talking about now.

00:03:16.950 --> 00:03:19.200
I've been reborn.

00:03:19.370 --> 00:03:23.460
I've become a species of stronger,
nobler blood.

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:25.960
-Master Yev?
-Yes.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:29.210
I've transcended my existence
as a Vampire,

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:31.380
and have become the True Ancestor.

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:35.930
-What's wrong?
-It's nothing.

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:38.770
Has being swallowed by the Ark
made you mad?

00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:42.850
Don't you see this torrent of power,
flowing out of me?

00:03:48.570 --> 00:03:50.110
What's wrong, Mikhail?

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:53.570
-Behold, this new form of Vampire.
-Master Yev.

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:57.490
But you're still Master Yev, right?

00:03:57.950 --> 00:03:59.120
The kind Master Yev,

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:02.080
who tries to save us
from the disease, right?

00:04:03.710 --> 00:04:04.880
Right.

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:08.000
You won't have to fear any disease.

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:15.220
You shall make a new pact with me,
the True Ancestor.

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:24.440
How weak.

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:27.480
Perhaps this suggests
that only noble blood

00:04:27.560 --> 00:04:29.480
is suitable for a noble being.

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:33.280
If so, how about you?

00:04:36.200 --> 00:04:39.030
No. No.

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:40.410
Stop it.

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:42.870
Master Yev.

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:45.540
What are you afraid of?

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:50.800
If my blood accepts you,
you shall also be reborn, you know.

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:54.220
No. No.

00:04:54.300 --> 00:04:55.130
Yevgraf.

00:04:57.010 --> 00:04:57.840
Yuliy.

00:04:58.390 --> 00:05:01.520
I told you that I'd stay with you,
even if you beat me.

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:03.810
Yuliy Jirov.

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:06.100
What are you doing here?

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:09.770
Have you finally decided
to become my pet dog?

00:05:10.320 --> 00:05:12.440
The Ark is not for you to possess.

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:14.360
For what reason?

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:19.120
Don't tell me that it's
because the Ark belongs to Sirius.

00:05:19.530 --> 00:05:20.700
You make me laugh.

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:22.580
How can you say that,

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:26.410
when your kind failed
to use this great power for 5,000 years?

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.790
And then to top it off, you sealed it.

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:35.300
I'd imagine the possessor must regret
giving it to you fools.

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:39.340
That's why I'm using it instead.

00:05:39.720 --> 00:05:42.470
As a matter of fact,
you should be thanking me.

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:47.600
The old weak Vampires must die out once.

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:50.690
Just like you fools, the Sirius, did.

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:53.980
But don't lose hope.

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:57.700
New Vampires will be born under me,

00:05:57.950 --> 00:06:01.870
and we will rule this world forever.

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:11.590
What the...?

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:17.630
What is going on?

00:06:19.010 --> 00:06:20.390
Is this part of the wisdom?

00:06:21.850 --> 00:06:23.100
No, it's not.

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:30.480
This is flowing out of the Ark.

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:33.150
My vessel is...

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:15.150
What the...?

00:07:15.440 --> 00:07:16.440
He's been swallowed.

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:19.570
Professor.

00:07:21.070 --> 00:07:22.240
-He's--
-Don't speak.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:27.370
He couldn't control the enormous force
that was contained in the Ark.

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:31.580
Yuliy,
why did you break the seal of the Ark?

00:07:33.040 --> 00:07:34.790
Because I promised my father...

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:37.500
I promised that I would live on
with the Ark.

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:41.340
<i>To prove that the new pride of Sirius</i>

00:07:42.010 --> 00:07:44.390
<i>that Father wished for wasn't wrong.</i>

00:07:46.550 --> 00:07:47.640
The new pride...

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:49.140
Yes.

00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:52.020
It is the will to coexist
with many other species.

00:07:53.600 --> 00:07:56.860
Even with humans and Vampires.

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:04.030
I understand.

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:07.160
Yuliy, I want to give you something.

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:12.000
The Ark of Sirius?

00:08:12.210 --> 00:08:13.420
This is its counterpart.

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:16.670
I found it deep in the temple of Dogville.

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:20.590
It is not mentioned,
even in the old document.

00:08:20.670 --> 00:08:22.840
It is only known
by the Sirius Royal Family,

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:24.260
the possessors of the Ark.

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:28.810
This would probably enable you
to control the enormous power of the Ark.

00:08:29.390 --> 00:08:32.350
Yuliy, follow the path you believe in.

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:35.690
And the Ark will surely respond
to your will.

00:08:36.810 --> 00:08:38.940
I know you can do it.

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:03.470
Mikhail.

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:17.980
Damn it.

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:23.280
This is not good.

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:25.240
We're losing altitude.

00:09:25.820 --> 00:09:26.650
Why?

00:09:28.320 --> 00:09:29.910
I've killed so many...

00:09:30.780 --> 00:09:32.990
Sirius... and Jaegers.

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:36.580
Why, then, did Yuliy say that?

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:38.750
He realized.

00:09:40.420 --> 00:09:45.010
He thought using the power of the Ark
could realize what he said.

00:10:15.080 --> 00:10:16.370
What is happening?

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:23.630
He can't stand the power of the Ark?

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:31.970
-You won't get away.
-Yuliy.

00:10:39.810 --> 00:10:40.980
<i>I've finally found it.</i>

00:10:42.110 --> 00:10:43.980
<i>I've finally found what I need to do.</i>

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:45.900
<i>I've found my path.</i>

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:03.330
Mikhail.

00:11:03.670 --> 00:11:06.800
You constantly make me watch your back,
little brother.

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:08.420
Let's go.

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:20.440
I am your opponent.

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:24.270
Mikhail.

00:11:29.780 --> 00:11:31.150
Give me...

00:11:31.530 --> 00:11:33.070
back the Ark already...

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:35.070
you bastard.

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:43.250
The Ark...

00:11:43.710 --> 00:11:48.130
My power as the True Ancestor...

00:11:48.800 --> 00:11:51.050
You blindly believed the Ark.

00:11:51.510 --> 00:11:53.010
Thus you were swallowed by it.

00:11:54.260 --> 00:11:56.010
But you...

00:11:56.470 --> 00:12:00.730
What could you possibly do on your own?

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:02.730
You are merely one Sirius
that barely survived.

00:12:02.810 --> 00:12:05.730
I need the Ark precisely
because I can't do anything alone.

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:08.190
In order to coexist with many species,

00:12:09.150 --> 00:12:13.240
I would even save Vampires.

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:15.660
Nonsense.

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:21.330
If I had to receive charity
from a filthy wolf,

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:25.670
I would rather choose a noble death.

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.630
Then you get what you wish for.

00:12:39.850 --> 00:12:41.180
How's your wound, Mikhail?

00:12:41.270 --> 00:12:42.430
I'm embarrassed.

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:45.560
After saying vengeance,
and everything else,

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:47.360
were all my responsibilities.

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:48.980
Don't.

00:12:50.480 --> 00:12:51.320
Yuliy.

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:54.030
I'm happy right now.

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:59.160
I'll finally be released
from the blood of Vampires,

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:01.330
the blood that killed Mother.

00:13:02.540 --> 00:13:03.370
Mikhail.

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:12.130
This shall be important to you.

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:17.010
I can only help you this much.

00:13:18.010 --> 00:13:18.850
Yuliy.

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:23.060
Survive. Live with the Ark.

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:24.480
Live.

00:13:27.520 --> 00:13:31.400
I'll prove the pride of the new Sirius.

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:33.400
Yes.

00:13:35.030 --> 00:13:39.070
You certainly are strong.

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:44.450
Mikhail.

00:13:52.210 --> 00:13:53.300
Of course I'm strong.

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:59.550
I'm your little brother.

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:03.930
Brother.

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.940
Brother.

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:32.290
Professor.

00:14:33.880 --> 00:14:34.800
Professor Willard.

00:14:36.420 --> 00:14:38.470
Yuliy...

00:14:40.800 --> 00:14:45.560
Is that the true appearance
of the possessor of the Ark?

00:14:46.560 --> 00:14:50.650
Yes. I will use this power for this world.

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:54.940
I believe that was the wish
of the possessor

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:56.690
who handed the Ark to the Sirius.

00:14:58.320 --> 00:15:01.820
And I will dedicate the remainder
of my life to realize this.

00:15:02.870 --> 00:15:04.990
-I see.
-But, professor...

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:09.290
if I get swallowed by the Ark,
like Yevgraf...

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:12.750
I need you to kill me...

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:15.170
as my second father.

00:15:16.920 --> 00:15:17.880
Goodbye, professor.

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:21.800
Or rather, Father.

00:15:23.470 --> 00:15:24.300
Yuliy.

00:15:29.930 --> 00:15:32.020
-Professor.
-Thank God, he woke up.

00:15:33.150 --> 00:15:35.310
-Where are we?
-A hospital in Odomari.

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:38.480
Local fishermen found you,
washed ashore, badly beat up.

00:15:38.570 --> 00:15:40.700
And they saved you.

00:15:41.030 --> 00:15:43.450
You slept for four days. I thought you'd--

00:15:43.530 --> 00:15:44.870
Stop crying, you wuss.

00:15:45.490 --> 00:15:46.740
You wouldn't let this go,

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:48.950
despite the fact
that you were unconscious.

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:50.120
Mr. Willard...

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:52.960
where is Yuliy?

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:55.000
Yes, professor. Where's Yuliy?

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:57.630
He left.

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:01.920
All alone,
he'll carry the enormous power...

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:04.930
that could either make him a god
or the devil.

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:12.980
I see. Management, huh?

00:16:13.310 --> 00:16:16.480
Yes. I go see a university professor
my father introduced me to,

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:17.980
about twice a week.

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:20.610
My father was surprised,

00:16:21.150 --> 00:16:24.240
because as soon as his tomboy daughter
returned from Sakhalin,

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:26.490
she told him she wishes
to study management

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:28.160
to someday inherit his company.

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:29.740
That's quite a transformation.

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:34.870
I finally realized how immature
and self-centered I was.

00:16:35.790 --> 00:16:41.960
But I don't think my wish
to help Yuliy was a mistake.

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:44.340
Well, it sure got me into trouble.

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:46.590
<i>I'm very sorry.</i>

00:16:49.560 --> 00:16:53.730
<i>In order to realize Yuliy's wish,</i>
<i>in my own way,</i>

00:16:54.310 --> 00:16:57.690
<i>I've decided to learn about society,</i>
<i>and to go out in the world.</i>

00:16:58.690 --> 00:17:05.070
<i>I think that is the best way for me now</i>
<i>to walk together with Yuliy.</i>

00:17:07.530 --> 00:17:10.660
I heard she'll be monitored for a while.

00:17:11.370 --> 00:17:15.290
You could assign men to monitor her,
but she doesn't know where the Ark is.

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:19.250
-I promise you that.
-Anyway, major...

00:17:19.670 --> 00:17:22.710
In the end, what is the Ark of Sirius?

00:17:24.420 --> 00:17:29.430
Mr. Willard said that the power of the Ark
could turn one into God or the devil.

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:32.600
Well, the human race is foolish,

00:17:32.680 --> 00:17:35.390
because we continue to clash egos
and hurt one another.

00:17:35.480 --> 00:17:37.980
I guess it means the Ark is far beyond
what humans can handle.

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:41.150
Yet our country,
and the great world powers,

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:44.280
will continue to chase the Ark
and Yuliy Jirov.

00:17:45.110 --> 00:17:48.950
Ultimately, this world will never change,
unless it goes through pain.

00:17:49.870 --> 00:17:54.410
How superficial and foolish the world is,
compared to the wish of that young boy.

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:57.040
So, major, what next?

00:17:57.580 --> 00:17:58.420
I don't know.

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:03.550
At any rate,
I shall do what only I could do.

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:07.720
I will do my best,
so that we can become an existence

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:10.260
that Yuliy would wish to coexist with.

00:18:12.600 --> 00:18:13.430
<i>Yuliy.</i>

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:18.640
<i>You've taught me that what we see</i>
<i>with our eyes isn't everything,</i>

00:18:19.310 --> 00:18:23.190
<i>and also how I should look at worlds</i>
<i>that are different from mine.</i>

00:18:24.360 --> 00:18:26.990
<i>So, even if we take different roads,</i>

00:18:27.530 --> 00:18:30.320
<i>our paths should</i>
<i>certainly cross somewhere,</i>

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:34.660
<i>as long as we each move on,</i>
<i>sharing the same will.</i>

00:18:35.370 --> 00:18:36.500
<i>That's what I believe.</i>

00:18:41.920 --> 00:18:46.920
<i>One of the mysteries of the Ark of Sirius</i>
<i>is the fact that there is no description</i>

00:18:47.010 --> 00:18:49.300
<i>concerning the use of the Ark</i>
<i>for 5,000 years.</i>

00:18:50.550 --> 00:18:53.550
<i>At Dogville, I learned an important fact:</i>

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:59.560
<i>Creatures of this planet are not capable</i>
<i>of handling the Ark in its original form.</i>

00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:04.400
<i>Thus a counterpart of the Ark was created,</i>

00:19:05.110 --> 00:19:09.610
<i>and that allowed the Sirius tribe</i>
<i>to use the power of the Ark.</i>

00:19:11.110 --> 00:19:13.780
But astounded by its sheer force
that far exceeds human wisdom,

00:19:13.870 --> 00:19:17.700
they decided that they were in no need
to use its power.

00:19:18.750 --> 00:19:21.830
Perhaps they entrusted it
to the Sirius of future generations.

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:23.460
And that was Yuliy.

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:27.130
Thanks to that,
the whole world is after him.

00:19:27.210 --> 00:19:28.380
And he got us involved.

00:19:29.010 --> 00:19:30.420
I can't believe the search for Yuliy

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:33.050
is prioritized
over the extermination of Vampires.

00:19:33.140 --> 00:19:34.850
It's not even a job for a Jaeger.

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:40.100
Yuliy broke the seal and used the Ark,
knowing that this would happen.

00:19:44.360 --> 00:19:45.270
Mr. Willard.

00:19:47.530 --> 00:19:49.690
-Yes.
-It's from Headquarters.

00:19:50.490 --> 00:19:56.700
A girl that seems to be a Royal was seen
with a young man in Khabarovsk.

00:19:57.370 --> 00:19:59.160
-That could be...
-It's possible.

00:19:59.910 --> 00:20:01.790
But with a Royal?

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:03.750
He didn't become one of them?

00:20:03.830 --> 00:20:06.420
-That would never happen.
-Get ready now.

00:20:07.420 --> 00:20:10.460
Headquarters wants us
to capture the young man?

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:12.760
We'll be Yuliy's enemy?

00:20:13.180 --> 00:20:15.220
Are you okay with that, professor?

00:20:15.890 --> 00:20:17.140
I'm not okay with that.

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:19.180
That's why we must hurry.

00:20:20.930 --> 00:20:23.890
The whole world is after him,
and we need to find him first.

00:20:24.560 --> 00:20:27.110
Isn't that something only we could do?

00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:30.650
You're right. We can think of what to--

00:20:30.740 --> 00:20:33.820
We'll think about that later.
I'll go check the ammo.

00:20:33.900 --> 00:20:35.240
I'll go get the car.

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:42.000
<i>Yuliy, right now,</i>
<i>I really want to see you.</i>

00:20:43.120 --> 00:20:45.790
<i>I want to see you,</i>
<i>and watch you walk your path.</i>

00:20:47.500 --> 00:20:51.380
<i>You might not like it, but your friends</i>
<i>and I are coming to see you.</i>

00:20:55.380 --> 00:20:57.390
<i>So, are you really coming?</i>

00:20:58.100 --> 00:21:00.640
<i>I mean, the Elders have already given up.</i>

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:08.310
<i>But if you come, Yuliy,</i>
<i>and convince everyone,</i>

00:21:09.190 --> 00:21:12.400
<i>they just might want</i>
<i>to do something about that disease.</i>

00:21:14.280 --> 00:21:17.030
<i>So, I'll wait. I'll be waiting for you.</i>

00:21:22.500 --> 00:21:25.410
<i>Please, help us, Yuliy.</i>

00:21:29.420 --> 00:21:30.250
There.

00:21:37.180 --> 00:21:38.680
<i>I hope she believes me.</i>

00:21:39.760 --> 00:21:42.100
<i>But if we can't believe one another,</i>

00:21:42.600 --> 00:21:44.350
<i>we can't go down this path.</i>

00:21:45.810 --> 00:21:48.100
<i>Everyone might think</i>
<i>that I'm being foolish,</i>

00:21:49.190 --> 00:21:53.070
<i>but I believe this is also the way</i>
<i>the pride of Sirius should be.</i>

00:21:55.280 --> 00:21:59.990
<i>I will probably witness many worlds</i>
<i>that do not intersect.</i>

00:22:02.450 --> 00:22:03.290
<i>But...</i>

00:22:04.500 --> 00:22:07.080
<i>if I don't give up on that...</i>

00:22:08.500 --> 00:22:12.380
<i>and if I could shed light</i>
<i>on our final destination...</i>

00:22:14.760 --> 00:22:17.220
<i>I must believe in this power</i>
<i>that was given to me.</i>

00:22:19.470 --> 00:22:21.640
<i>Isn't that right, Mikhail?</i>

00:22:25.430 --> 00:22:26.560
<i>I am a Sirius.</i>

00:22:28.230 --> 00:22:29.190
<i>And I am...</i>

00:22:31.060 --> 00:22:34.440
<i>I am the protector of the world,</i>
<i>and the connector of worlds.</i>

00:24:17.340 --> 00:24:20.840
Subtitle translation by Kozo Komori
